      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/converter/HttpMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.converter\"><code>HttpMessageConverters</code></a> that should be used with\nthe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>. Setting this value will replace any previously configured\nconverters and any converters configured on the builder will replace RestTemplate's\ndefault converters.",
      "translation": "设置要与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> 一起使用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/converter/HttpMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.converter\"><code>HttpMessageConverters</code></a>。设置此值将替换任何先前配置的转换器，而构建器上配置的转换器将替换 RestTemplate 的默认转换器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add additional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/converter/HttpMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.converter\"><code>HttpMessageConverters</code></a> that should be\nused with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>. Any converters configured on the builder will\nreplace RestTemplate's default converters.",
      "translation": "添加额外的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/converter/HttpMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.converter\"><code>HttpMessageConverters</code></a>，这些转换器将用于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>。在构建器上配置的任意转换器将替换 RestTemplate 的默认转换器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequestInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequestInterceptors</code></a> that\nshould be used with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>. Setting this value will replace any\npreviously defined interceptors.",
      "translation": "设置要与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> 一起使用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequestInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequestInterceptors</code></a>。设置此值将替换任何先前定义的拦截器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"RestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateCustomizers</code></a> that should be\napplied to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>. Customizers are applied in the order that they\nwere added after builder configuration has been applied. Setting this value will\nreplace any previously configured customizers.",
      "translation": "设置要应用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> 的 <a href=\"RestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateCustomizers</code></a>。自定义器在构建器配置应用后，按照添加顺序进行应用。设置此值将替换任何先前配置的自定义器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add <a href=\"RestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateCustomizers</code></a> that should be applied\nto the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>. Customizers are applied in the order that they were\nadded after builder configuration has been applied.",
      "translation": "添加应应用于<a href=\"RestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateCustomizers</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>。自定义器在应用构建器配置后，按照添加的顺序进行应用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"RestTemplateRequestCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateRequestCustomizers</code></a> that\nshould be applied to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequest</code></a>. Customizers are applied in the\norder that they were added. Setting this value will replace any previously\nconfigured request customizers.",
      "translation": "设置应应用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequest</code></a> 的<a href=\"RestTemplateRequestCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateRequestCustomizers</code></a>。自定义器按添加顺序应用。设置此值将替换任何先前配置过的请求自定义器。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the <a href=\"RestTemplateRequestCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateRequestCustomizers</code></a> that\nshould be applied to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequest</code></a>. Customizers are applied in the\norder that they were added.",
      "translation": "添加应应用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequest</code></a> 的<a href=\"RestTemplateRequestCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.restclient\"><code>RestTemplateRequestCustomizers</code></a>。自定义定制器按照添加的顺序应用。",
