    {
      "source": "By default, the built <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> will attempt to use the most suitable\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequestFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequestFactory</code></a>, call <a href=\"#detectRequestFactory(boolean)\"><code>detectRequestFactory(false)</code></a> if you prefer to keep the default. In a typical\nauto-configured Spring Boot application this builder is available as a bean and can be\ninjected whenever a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> is needed.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，构建的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>将尝试使用最合适的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/ClientHttpRequestFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequestFactory</code></a>，如果您希望保留默认设置，可调用<a href=\"#detectRequestFactory(boolean)\"><code>detectRequestFactory(false)</code></a>。在典型的自动配置的 Spring Boot 应用程序中，该构建器可作为 Bean 提供，并在需要<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>时进行注入。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the <a href=\"../http/client/HttpClientSettings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.http.client\"><code>HttpClientSettings</code></a>. This will replace any previously set\n<a href=\"#connectTimeout(java.time.Duration)\"><code>connectTimeout</code></a>, <a href=\"#readTimeout(java.time.Duration)\"><code>readTimeout</code></a> and <a href=\"#sslBundle(org.springframework.boot.ssl.SslBundle)\"><code>sslBundle</code></a> values.",
      "translation": "设置 <a href=\"../http/client/HttpClientSettings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.http.client\"><code>HttpClientSettings</code></a>。这将替换任何先前设置的<a href=\"#connectTimeout(java.time.Duration)\"><code>connectTimeout</code></a>、<a href=\"#readTimeout(java.time.Duration)\"><code>readTimeout</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#sslBundle(org.springframework.boot.ssl.SslBundle)\"><code>sslBundle</code></a> 值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add additional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/converter/HttpMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.converter\"><code>HttpMessageConverters</code></a> that should be\nused with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>.",
